---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="CN Books privacy policy" noindex>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container-x legal-inner">
      <h1>CN Books privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated November 6, 2026</p>
      <p>CN Books is an internal bookkeeping tool that CatalystNeuro LLC ("CatalystNeuro") built for its own use. It connects only to CatalystNeuro's own QuickBooks Online company and is not offered to other companies or the public.</p>
      <h2>What it accesses</h2>
      <p>With the authorization of CatalystNeuro's QuickBooks administrator, CN Books reads and updates CatalystNeuro's accounting records in QuickBooks Online: invoices, customers, vendors, expenses, payments and accounting reports. It uses these records only to run CatalystNeuro's own invoicing, contractor payments and bookkeeping.</p>
      <h2>How data is stored and shared</h2>
      <p>Authorization tokens and working copies of reports are stored on a computer controlled by CatalystNeuro and readable only by CatalystNeuro's administrator. CatalystNeuro does not sell or share this data with third parties and does not use it for advertising.</p>
      <h2>Disconnecting</h2>
      <p>The QuickBooks administrator can disconnect CN Books at any time from the Apps section of QuickBooks Online. CatalystNeuro then deletes the stored authorization tokens.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:ben.dichter@catalystneuro.com">ben.dichter@catalystneuro.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-inner { max-width: 46rem; padding-block: 3rem 4rem; }
  .legal h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .legal p { margin-top: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .legal .muted { color: var(--color-ink-muted); }
</style>
